{
  "info": {
    "name": "Library API",
    "description": "Collection Postman compl\u00e8te pour l'API de Gestion de Biblioth\u00e8que.\n\n## Authentification\n- Login avec abdy / 24068Supnum \u2192 r\u00e9cup\u00e9rer le token\n- D\u00e9finir la variable `token` manuellement ou via le script du login\n\n## Variables\n- `baseUrl`: `http://localhost:8082`\n- `token`: token JWT (d\u00e9fini automatiquement apr\u00e8s login)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "library"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8082",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Authentification publique",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "}",
                  ""
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"abdy\",\n    \"password\": \"24068Supnum\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Authentification publique. Retourne un token JWT + username + role."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Login Success",
              "body": "{\n    \"token\": \"eyJhbGci...\",\n    \"username\": \"abdy\",\n    \"role\": \"ADMIN\"\n}",
              "code": 200,
              "header": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Login Invalid",
              "body": "{\n    \"error\": \"Invalid credentials\"\n}",
              "code": 401,
              "header": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Update My Credentials",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"currentPassword\": \"24068Supnum\",\n    \"newUsername\": \"abdy_new\",\n    \"newPassword\": \"newPassword123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "profile"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Permet \u00e0 l'utilisateur connect\u00e9 de changer son username et/ou son mot de passe. Le token est reg\u00e9n\u00e9r\u00e9 automatiquement."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
